  ('seo_title__doctor', 'Optometrist, Eyeglass Gallery'),
  ('doctor.hdr_heading', 'Meet Dr. Matt Chavoustie'),
  ('doctor.hdr_text', 'Full-time, on-site optometrist providing the Burlington community with exceptional, patient-first eye care for over 15 years.'),
  ('doctor.s01_eyebrow', 'Dr. Matt Chavoustie · OD'),
  ('doctor.s01_heading', 'Full-time, on-site optometrist'),
  ('doctor.s01_text', 'Originally from the 1000 Islands region of New York State, Dr. Chavoustie moved to the GTA to be closer to his wife''s family in Hamilton. He has provided the Burlington community with exceptional eye care for the last 15 years.'),
  ('doctor.s01_item', 'Comprehensive vision & eye-health assessments'),
  ('doctor.s01_item2', 'Glaucoma, macular degeneration & diabetic retinopathy'),
  ('doctor.s01_item3', 'Specialty contact lens fittings'),
  ('doctor.s01_item4', 'Children''s and seniors'' eye care'),
  ('doctor.s02_heading', 'Education & training'),
  ('doctor.s02_text', 'Dr. Chavoustie completed his undergraduate studies at the State University of New York at Oswego in 2004, receiving a Bachelor''s Degree in Biological Sciences. He earned his Doctor of Optometry degree from the prestigious New England College of Optometry in Boston in 2009, where he also met his wife, fellow optometrist Dr. Anjali Pathak.'),
  ('doctor.s02_text2', 'During his final-year rotations, Dr. Chavoustie trained coast to coast across a wide variety of clinical settings, focusing on fitting specialty contact lenses and co-managing LASIK patients in Atlanta, Georgia. After graduation he was accepted into the Ocular Disease Residency Program at the Boston Veteran''s Affairs Hospital System, working alongside globally-renowned specialists in glaucoma, retinal and corneal disease.'),
  ('doctor.s02_text3', 'He has managed complex ocular diseases, including glaucoma, macular degeneration and diabetic retinopathy, at VA Hospitals in New York''s Hudson Valley and Portland, and cared for an under-served community at Boston''s Upham''s Corner Community Health Center. When not in the office, he enjoys exploring all that Burlington offers with his wife and their two young children.'),
  ('doctor.s03_title', 'Areas of Expertise'),
  ('doctor.s03_title2', 'Ocular Disease'),
  ('doctor.s03_text', 'Diagnosis and co-management of glaucoma, macular degeneration and diabetic retinopathy.'),
  ('doctor.s03_title3', 'Specialty Contacts'),
  ('doctor.s03_text2', 'Expert fitting of specialty and hard-to-fit contact lenses for a comfortable, precise result.'),
  ('doctor.s03_title4', 'Family & LASIK Care'),
  ('doctor.s03_text3', 'Children''s and seniors'' eye care, plus LASIK co-management from consult to follow-up.'),
  ('doctor.s04_text', 'We took the kids to Dr. Chavoustie and he and his assistant were amazing. Very professional, friendly and efficient, but we did not feel rushed at all. You could tell they both love kids and took the time to explain what they were doing.'),
  ('doctor.s04_name', 'Ileanna I., Burlington'),
  ('doctor.s05_eyebrow', 'Ready when you are'),
  ('doctor.s05_heading', 'Book Your Eye Exam'),
  ('doctor.s05_text', 'Reserve a comprehensive exam online in just a few clicks. We bill most major insurers directly.'),
  ('seo_description__doctor', 'Meet Dr. Matt Chavoustie, the full-time on-site optometrist at Eyeglass Gallery in Burlington.'),
  ('seo_title__about', 'About Us, Eyeglass Gallery'),
  ('about.hdr_heading', 'Family-Owned. Community-Loved.'),
  ('about.hdr_text', 'Proudly serving Burlington and the surrounding area with name-brand eyewear and specialty optical services, and treating every patient like family.'),
  ('about.s01_title', 'Meet Our Team'),
  ('about.s01_text', 'Our team of optical professionals includes opticians, lab technicians, frame stylists and a full-time on-site optometrist with over 15 years of experience serving the Burlington community.'),
  ('about.s02_text', 'Eyeglass Gallery is Burlington''s trusted optical boutique, recognized with the Burlington Post Readers'' Choice **Gold Award for Best Optical Store**. We pair the craft of independent eyewear with the care of a modern optometry practice, because your eyes, and how you see the world, deserve nothing less.'),
  ('about.s02_text2', 'Every face is different, and so is every recommendation we make. Our optical professionals take the time to understand your vision needs, your lifestyle and your style before helping you choose the perfect frames and lenses.'),
  ('about.s03_eyebrow', 'Where fashion meets value'),
  ('about.s03_heading', '2 for 1 Optical'),
  ('about.s03_text', 'We''re a 2-for-1 optical, so there''s no compromise on fashion or style to stay on budget. Buy one pair of eyeglasses or sunglasses and get a second pair of equal or lesser value at no charge. Some exceptions apply, just ask us for details.'),
  ('about.s04_title', 'The Eyeglass Gallery Difference'),
  ('about.s04_title2', 'Award-Winning Care'),
  ('about.s04_text', 'Readers'' Choice Gold for Best Optical Store, recognized by the community we serve every day.'),
  ('about.s04_title3', 'Advanced Technology'),
  ('about.s04_text2', 'On-site imaging, testing and lens-edging for faster, more precise results.'),
  ('about.s04_title4', 'Personalized Service'),
  ('about.s04_text3', 'Onsite frame stylists and optometrists who treat every patient like family.'),
  ('about.s05_title', 'Awards & Reviews'),
  ('about.s05_title2', 'Readers'' Choice Gold 2024'),
  ('about.s05_text', 'Voted one of Burlington''s best optical stores, GOLD winner in the Burlington Post Readers'' Choice poll.'),
  ('about.s05_title3', 'Google 5-Star Rated'),
  ('about.s05_text2', 'Loved by our customers and patients. [Read our Google reviews](https://www.google.com/search?q=eyeglass+gallery+burlington).'),
  ('about.s05_title4', 'Top-Rated Optometrist'),
  ('about.s05_text3', 'Dr. Matt Chavoustie is recognized among Burlington''s top optometrists on [RateMDs](https://www.ratemds.com/best-doctors/on/burlington/optometrist/) and Three Best Rated.'),
  ('about.s06_text', 'One might ask why I would go 20 kilometres out of my way to buy my eyeglasses. Simple, because this place is constantly professional, friendly, and they stand by their product. One of the best customer service experiences you can get.'),
  ('about.s06_name', 'Claudia P., Mississauga'),
  ('about.s07_eyebrow', 'Come say hello'),
  ('about.s07_heading', 'Visit us in Burlington'),
  ('about.s07_text', 'Drop by our retail store and eye exam room, both wheelchair accessible, or book your visit online.'),
  ('seo_description__about', 'Meet the family-owned team behind Eyeglass Gallery, Burlington''s award-winning optical boutique.'),
  ('seo_title__contact', 'Contact, Eyeglass Gallery'),
  ('contact.hdr_heading', 'Get in Touch'),
  ('contact.hdr_text', 'Questions, prescriptions, or ready to book? Reach us by phone, email or drop by the store, we''re happy to help.'),
  ('contact.s01_eyebrow', 'Store details'),
  ('contact.s01_title', 'Address'),
  ('contact.s01_title2', 'Phone'),
  ('contact.s01_title3', 'Email'),
  ('contact.s01_title4', 'Hours'),
  ('contact.s01_title5', 'Accessibility'),
  ('contact.s01_text2', 'Our retail store and eye exam room are wheelchair accessible.'),
  ('contact.s01_eyebrow2', 'Send a message'),
  ('contact.s02_eyebrow', 'Prefer to book online?'),
  ('contact.s02_heading', 'Reserve your exam anytime'),
  ('contact.s02_text', 'Book a comprehensive eye exam or styling consultation through our online booking system.'),
  ('seo_description__contact', 'Contact Eyeglass Gallery in Burlington. Call 905.331.5999 or book your eye exam online.'),
